# ===================================
# 保留的文件（白名单）
# ===================================
# 确保这些重要文件被跟踪
!requirements.txt
!README.md
!.gitignore

# Reviewer / supplementary material under review/ must be tracked
# even though *.md / *.json / *.txt / *.py are globally restricted.
!review/
!review/**
!review/examples/
!review/examples/**
# ...except auto-generated bytecode and OS artefacts.
review/**/__pycache__/
review/**/*.pyc
